Autoresolve oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-15. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Adds OracleSeedRandom and a draw trace to sgp/Random.cc, moves the end-of-battle block of RenderAutoResolve into
HandleAutoResolveBattleEnd (no behaviour change), adds a slice budget to ProcessBattleFrame (inactive unless the oracle
sets it) and exports a headless Finish-mode autoresolve (OracleAutoResolve*). Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0001.

